Mother will say, I washed your potty, how will you teach me?

5300
05:27:07,100 --> 05:27:13,020
Right? And yeah, so that comes in the parents, that stiffness comes after one point.

5301
05:27:13,100 --> 05:27:21,920
Rest, what you said is that if you can't help, at least don't add to our stress.

5302
05:27:22,000 --> 05:27:27,020
It's a good line you wrote and it's absolutely right.

5303
05:27:27,100 --> 05:27:30,100
We have to have a baby soon.

5304
05:27:31,100 --> 05:27:33,841
Pregnancies have been glamorized.

5305
05:27:33,921 --> 05:27:36,784
After that, there is nothing on it.

5306
05:27:36,864 --> 05:27:39,713
There is nothing on postpartum.

5307
05:27:39,793 --> 05:27:43,150
There is nothing on early stage neonatal care.

5308
05:27:43,230 --> 05:27:45,287
And there is no focus on that.

5309
05:27:45,367 --> 05:27:47,860
But the focus is on the first year.

5310
05:27:47,940 --> 05:27:51,288
And if you give birth, then what is the matter?

5311
05:27:51,368 --> 05:27:52,508
What to do next?

5312
05:27:52,588 --> 05:27:53,434
Tell me this.

5313
05:27:53,514 --> 05:27:54,440
No, not that.

5314
05:27:54,520 --> 05:27:56,159
You know that yourself.

5315
05:27:56,239 --> 05:27:57,130
But we criticize.

5316
05:27:57,210 --> 05:28:08,130
We will come to do this, but we will not tell you how to tackle it.

5317
05:28:08,210 --> 05:28:10,130
So this is a strange society.

5318
05:28:10,210 --> 05:28:18,130
So we celebrate babies and Mashallah, but we don't ask the mother.

5319
05:28:18,210 --> 05:28:23,210
Ask the mother too, what is she going through, what pain is she in?

5320
05:28:23,960 --> 05:28:26,451
And postpartum depression is real.

5321
05:28:26,531 --> 05:28:33,005
Guys, if you don't come into fatherhood, you will see a new wife.

5322
05:28:33,085 --> 05:28:35,560
You will say, who is this?

5323
05:28:35,640 --> 05:28:37,032
Who is this person?

5324
05:28:37,112 --> 05:28:39,867
What is he doing in my house?

5325
05:28:39,947 --> 05:28:45,220
And if I am picturing something very wrong, I am really sorry.

5326
05:28:45,300 --> 05:28:48,744
People can deal with it differently, of course.

5327
05:28:48,824 --> 05:28:50,290
But it is very real.

5328
05:28:52,140 --> 05:28:59,633
It's so bad that some mothers have these feelings from inside that they want to put a pillow on their child's face.

5329
05:28:59,713 --> 05:29:00,947
I'm not making this up.

5330
05:29:01,027 --> 05:29:02,799
Google it, chat, GPD, whatever.

5331
05:29:02,879 --> 05:29:04,708
These feelings come from inside.

5332
05:29:04,788 --> 05:29:09,557
Because hormonal changes are happening, the body is in a strange overhaul.

5333
05:29:09,637 --> 05:29:14,003
Think about it, man, for 9 months, something else has been going on inside.

5334
05:29:14,083 --> 05:29:14,383
Okay?

5335
05:29:14,463 --> 05:29:16,771
After that, the body is in reset mode.

5336
05:29:16,851 --> 05:29:19,720
So when it goes into reset mode, then it is obviously

5337
05:29:19,800 --> 05:29:23,920
The autopilot will also be affected.

5338
05:29:24,000 --> 05:29:26,920
It takes time for it to reset.

5339
05:29:27,000 --> 05:29:27,920
Okay?

5340
05:29:28,000 --> 05:29:29,920
So it brings in weird thoughts.

5341
05:29:30,000 --> 05:29:31,920
And it brings in such thoughts.

5342
05:29:32,000 --> 05:29:34,920
Which then the mothers obviously regret.

5343
05:29:35,000 --> 05:29:36,920
Who would want a mother like this?

5344
05:29:37,000 --> 05:29:37,920
But these thoughts come.

5345
05:29:38,000 --> 05:29:39,920
Now think about what level of depression that must be.

5346
05:29:40,000 --> 05:29:42,920
How can you think about a newborn?

5347
05:29:43,000 --> 05:29:44,920
But it comes.

5348
05:29:45,000 --> 05:29:46,290
Not everyone gets it. I'm not saying everyone gets it.

5349
05:29:46,370 --> 05:29:49,024
But it happens, it's very very real.

5350
05:29:49,104 --> 05:29:56,277
So please be very very mindful of a new mother and she should be taken care of.

5351
05:29:56,357 --> 05:29:58,928
Not supervision or control.

5352
05:29:59,008 --> 05:30:00,675
Don't control her.

5353
05:30:00,755 --> 05:30:01,055
Okay?

5354
05:30:01,135 --> 05:30:06,971
In olden times, there were many women who were in the care of the women.

5355
05:30:07,051 --> 05:30:10,516
It's a delicate period for a woman in her life.

5356
05:30:10,596 --> 05:30:12,310
Now you can't do it.

5357
05:30:12,390 --> 05:30:15,310
You can't afford it. You are not a Mughal-e-Azam.

5358
05:30:15,390 --> 05:30:22,310
But if you can't arrange for it, then learn to give it yourself.

5359
05:30:22,390 --> 05:30:31,310
And make sure that, criticism aside, you have to create a very relaxing environment.

5360
05:30:31,390 --> 05:30:37,310
You have to create boundaries for outsiders so that they don't ruin your family's peace.

5361
05:30:37,390 --> 05:30:39,390
Because they will run away with poison.

5362
05:30:40,020 --> 05:30:45,220
Now you have toxicity in your house. So you have to be mindful of this.

5363
05:30:45,300 --> 05:30:51,508
Rest, this perfect mom syndrome, I would like to say a little on this, is that again,

5364
05:30:51,588 --> 05:30:54,078
Instagram moms, the mommy bloggers,

5365
05:30:54,158 --> 05:30:58,720
they might paint a very good picture or a very perfect picture.

5366
05:30:58,800 --> 05:31:02,323
Your competition is not with any mommy blogger.

5367
05:31:02,403 --> 05:31:05,636
Their accounts are different.

5368
05:31:05,716 --> 05:31:07,240
Your life is different.

5369
05:31:07,320 --> 05:31:10,040
You can't be that, they can't be you.

5370
05:31:10,120 --> 05:31:13,840
So, learn from someone's experience.

5371
05:31:13,920 --> 05:31:20,440
But don't idealize someone so much that you feel that there is something missing in my perfection.

5372
05:31:20,520 --> 05:31:23,258
Because, as it happens, they are such a happy couple,

5373
05:31:23,338 --> 05:31:28,240
they are so good and they are twirling and this is happening and that is happening.

5374
05:31:28,320 --> 05:31:31,240
That is a different thing, off camera, the energy that you don't see.

5375
05:31:31,320 --> 05:31:34,720
But on camera, then you say, they don't talk to me.

5376
05:31:35,190 --> 05:31:39,270
So when you see that contrast, I'm sure, now I'm not a mommy,

5377
05:31:39,350 --> 05:31:45,013
so I don't watch mommy bloggers, but I'm sure some mom would have thought that,

5378
05:31:45,093 --> 05:31:50,604
how perfect mom is, how good birthday party she has done, how good the setup is,

5379
05:31:50,684 --> 05:31:52,973
how good this and that is.

5380
05:31:53,053 --> 05:31:59,807
So you're not chasing to be a perfect mom, just like influencer life is very fake,

5381
05:31:59,887 --> 05:32:01,760
mommy blogging is also fake.

5382
05:32:03,300 --> 05:32:05,700
might be too hyper-realistic.

5383
05:32:07,340 --> 05:32:08,700
I'm not saying that they are lying.

5384
05:32:09,140 --> 05:32:13,540
I'm saying that it might come across as far more perfect than your own life.

5385
05:32:14,460 --> 05:32:18,540
So, please check this out. I'm not against any blogger, please.

5386
05:32:19,340 --> 05:32:22,460
But you don't have to chase perfection.

5387
05:32:22,540 --> 05:32:26,500
You just need to be present for your child and you just need to be present for your family.

5388
05:32:27,020 --> 05:32:28,460
You can do that much.

5389
05:32:28,580 --> 05:32:31,260
You don't have to be a rockstar mommy.

5390
05:32:31,940 --> 05:32:34,500
juggling between this role and that role.

5391
05:32:35,020 --> 05:32:36,620
Just be present for your child.

5392
05:32:36,700 --> 05:32:41,420
The child needs a lot of supervision, a lot of comfort and a lot of care.

5393
05:32:42,900 --> 05:32:45,260
So just be present, right? You make sure.

5394
05:32:45,420 --> 05:32:50,750
And in chase of perfection, many people forget the basic things.

5395
05:32:50,830 --> 05:32:52,695
The basic things are left.

5396
05:32:52,775 --> 05:32:59,150
So don't make sure you don't lose yourself in that pursuit and your son loses.

5397
05:32:59,230 --> 05:33:04,326
loses his mother or his or her mother in that pursuit of perfection.

5398
05:33:04,406 --> 05:33:11,752
So be very, very present for your child and for your family around you and be for others,

5399
05:33:11,832 --> 05:33:19,135
please offer as much comfort as you can because it's a very delicate period and you don't want to mess this up.

